  "event_seq": 90,
  "root_problem": "Since the 2026-09-09 gateway change (CHG-77) disabled idempotency-key enforcement on capture retries and it was never rolled back, gateway-timeout-triggered automatic capture retries are now sent to the PSP without an idempotency key, so the PSP can no longer deduplicate them and each retry produces a second successful capture on the same order. This directly accounts for the jump in orders_with_2_captures (0 to 118-124/day) and the sustained surge in double-charge support tickets (9-11/week to 288-301/week) starting 2026-09-09 (E-01, E-02, E-03, E-04)."
